4724: # The preflight decision for one identity, local checks only (credentials, then the
4725: # endpoint's recorded health): { State available|unavailable|unknown; Preflight (the
4726: # ledger's preflight text); Reason (one phrase: why a roster walk skips it); Refusal (the
4727: # refusal message of a real run); Label (the dry-run line) }.
4728: #   unresolved identity          unknown
4729: #   credentials missing/unknown  unavailable / unknown (Get-ProviderCredential)
4730: #   auth failure <= 24 h         unavailable
4731: #   usage limit with a known     unavailable: usage limit until <iso>
4732: #   reset in the future
